  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equipping Families for the Benefits of Labour Mobility in Vanuatu &#x2013; Phase II: Enhancing Circular Pathways</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &quot;Equipping Families for the Benefits of Labour Mobility in Vanuatu &#x2013; Phase II: Enhancing Circular Pathways&quot; programme seeks to expand the Famili I Redi pre-departure workshops to every province in Vanuatu. It will also pilot a community-led approach by building the capacity of partners and local communities, particularly in rural areas, to deliver these workshops. The project will offer sustainable reintegration support through a range of workshops and training programmes, with a focus on safe construction practices and counseling services.</narrative>
  </description>
